[[File:ON-creature-Thurvokun 02.jpg|thumb|right|Thurvokun casting Plague Breath]]
'''Thurvokun''' is a long-dead [[ON:Bone Dragon|Dragon]] who once dwelled in the Dwarven ruin of [[ON:Fang Lair|Fang Lair]]. The necromancer [[ON:Orryn the Black|Orryn the Black]] has discovered his remains there and is attempting to resurrect him. At the end of the dungeon, he will succeed in doing so and Thurvokun's undead skeleton must be fought.

In life his Dragon Priest was [[ON:Zaan the Scalecaller|Zaan the Scalecaller]], though he later abandoned her and the Dragon Cult to go to Arkngthamz-Phng and drive the [[ON:Dwemer|Dwemer]] from it so he could inhabit it in isolation. He was one of the few dragons to have survived the [[Lore:Dragon War|Dragon War]], until the adventurers [[ON:Caluurion|Caluurion]], [[ON:Sabina Cedus|Sabina Cedus]], and [[ON:Ulfnor|Ulfnor]] slew him in the late [[Lore:First Era|First Era]].
