==Notes==
* Thurvokun was originally mentioned in [[Arena:Arena|''Arena'']] as part of the [[Arena:Fang Lair|Fang Lair]] quest (''"Legend has it that a Great Wyrm drove the Dwarves from their home in the Dragon's Teeth, and took the Lair for itself."''), making him the first dragon mentioned in the whole series. However, he was not given a name at the time.
* ''Thurvokun'' may translate to "Overlord-Opposite-Moonlight" or "Overlord Shadow" in  the [[Lore:Dragon Language|Dragon Language]].

